      "amount": "1/4 teaspoon"
    }
  ],
  "instructions": [
    "Heat the olive oil in a large lacquerware bowl over medium heat.",
    "Add the chopped onion and cook until it is translucent and starting to caramelize.",
    "Add the minced garlic and grated ginger and cook for 1 minute, stirring constantly.",
    "Add the lamb cubes and cook until they are browned on all sides.",
    "Add the cumin, coriander, cayenne pepper, salt, and black pepper, and stir to combine.",
    "Pour in the lemon juice and bring the mixture to a simmer.",
    "Reduce the heat to low and cook, covered, for 1 1/2 hours, or until the lamb is tender.",
    "Serve the tagine hot, garnished with fresh parsley or cilantro, if desired."
  ],
